WEBVTT

00:15.392 --> 00:20.653
The camera's on, the smile is bright

00:22.874 --> 00:27.536
Another take in the burning light

00:30.162 --> 00:34.064
They painted the set with a perfect blue But it

00:34.124 --> 00:38.286
doesn't feel real, it doesn't feel true We're

00:38.326 --> 00:43.088
living under a plastic sky They tell me jump, I

00:43.448 --> 00:50.171
ask how high It's just a set, it's all a lie Living

00:50.992 --> 00:54.393
under a plastic sky

00:55.534 --> 00:57.215
Woah

00:59.473 --> 01:04.016
My guitar is clean, the drums are thin.

01:07.118 --> 01:11.381
They polished away all the grit and sin.

01:15.917 --> 01:20.920
I wanna roar, but they just ask me to sing some

01:20.980 --> 01:26.502
more We're living under a plastic sky They tell

01:26.522 --> 01:33.026
me jump, I ask how high It's just a set, it's all a

01:33.186 --> 01:37.168
lie Living under a plastic sky

01:41.350 --> 01:45.792
Is this the dream we were chasing? A different

01:45.892 --> 01:50.694
part, a different face. I'm losing me, I'm

01:50.754 --> 01:54.675
losing you.

01:55.116 --> 02:00.818
You know I love Chastity.

02:17.719 --> 02:22.061
We're living under a plastic sky They tell me

02:22.101 --> 02:28.123
jump, I ask how high It's just a set, it's all a lie

02:28.563 --> 02:32.124
Living under a plastic sky Plastic sky Feeling

02:32.164 --> 02:32.484
so new

02:50.210 --> 02:50.491
you.

